# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Battery voltage on header J3: 100k/20k divider into D2 (analog pin 2).
# Needs a HAL release that reads analog pins as volts. HAL v0.1.1
# does not: its battery monitor reports unavailable. See the README.

# Divider ratio 6.0; calibrate BATT_VOLT_MULT with a meter. Max 4S.
BATT_MONITOR 3
BATT_VOLT_PIN 2
BATT_VOLT_MULT 6.0
